WEBVTT

00:00:00.185 --> 00:00:03.254
Your product catalog, in one file

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:08.721
<b>Exportar catálogo</b> (export) downloads all your products with prices, stock and photos

00:00:08.849 --> 00:00:13.678
To load it on another register, or restore it, use <b>Importar catálogo</b> (import)

00:00:13.755 --> 00:00:19.386
Before writing anything, MiCaja shows you what will happen to each product

00:00:19.457 --> 00:00:26.047
If something changes, you see its <b>before</b> and <b>after</b>, and the button tells you how many products it will write

00:00:26.194 --> 00:00:34.145
Importing never deletes anything. To back up the whole system, go to Configuración (settings)
